  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "the fear of doing the longer stretch alone is overwhelming",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five years versus three years is a huge gap",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "Part of me wants to hold out on some kind of loyalty, but the fear"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "staying quiet now feels pointless and terrifying",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "the extra two years stacking up if I don't act",
