    "pd_decision_conflict": "My first instinct says something about staying silent is more honorable, but"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "the fear of losing five years for nothing",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "losing five years for nothing when they've already sold me out",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "some part of me flinches at the idea of confirming their betrayal"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "my fear about the extra time locked away pushes me hard",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "The math says three years beats five",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "there's a nagging worry too, about becoming someone who reacts only out of fear"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "worrying about what five years alone would actually do to my life",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "give evidence just to cut the loss to three years",
