    "pd_decision_conflict": "not proudly, but because the alternative terrifies me more"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "scared of what five years actually means for my life outside",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "There's a pull toward staying silent... but I'm scared"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "Reading this made my pulse pick up right away",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Three years shared feels safer than five years alone",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "there's a real worry sitting in my chest about what choosing this way says"
  }
